<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dasturchi Bo'lish — 2025</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@300;400;600;700;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #050508;
  --surface: #0d0d14;
  --surface2: #13131e;
  --border: #1e1e30;
  --border2: #2a2a40;
  --text: #eeeef8;
  --dim: #7777a0;
  --muted: #3a3a58;
  --c: #00f0ff;
  --c2: #8b5cf6;
  --c3: #f97316;
  --c4: #22d3ee;
  --c5: #4ade80;
  --c6: #f43f5e;
  --frontend: #38bdf8;
  --backend: #a78bfa;
  --devops: #fb923c;
  --cyber: #f472b6;
  --ai: #34d399;
  --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  --display: 'Unbounded', sans-serif;
  --body: 'Sora', sans-serif;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html, body { width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family:var(--body); }

/* SLIDE ENGINE */
#deck {
  width:100vw; height:100vh;
  position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}

.slide {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  padding:4rem 3rem;
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateX(100vw);
  transition:transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(.77,0,.175,1), opacity 0.4s ease;
  pointer-events:none;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.slide.active {
  opacity:1;
  transform:translateX(0);
  pointer-events:all;
}
.slide.prev {
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateX(-100vw);
}

/* SHARED BG GRID */
.slide::before {
  content:'';
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(30,30,48,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(30,30,48,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:50px 50px;
  mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 90% at 50% 50%, black 20%, transparent 80%);
  pointer-events:none;
}

/* NAV */
#nav {
  position:fixed; bottom:2rem; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
  z-index:200;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;
  background:rgba(13,13,20,0.9);
  backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:100px;
  padding:0.6rem 1.2rem;
}
.nav-btn {
  width:36px; height:36px;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid var(--border2);
  background:transparent;
  color:var(--dim);
  font-size:1rem;
  cursor:pointer;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  transition:all 0.2s;
}
.nav-btn:hover { border-color:var(--c); color:var(--c); }
.nav-btn:disabled { opacity:0.2; cursor:default; }

#dots { display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; }
.dot {
  width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--muted);
  transition:all 0.3s;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.dot.active { background:var(--c); width:20px; border-radius:3px; }

#slideNum {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem;
  color:var(--dim); letter-spacing:0.1em;
  min-width:40px; text-align:center;
}

/* KEY HINT */
#keyHint {
  position:fixed; top:1.5rem; right:1.5rem;
  z-index:200;
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.58rem;
  color:var(--muted);
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;
}
.kbd {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  width:22px; height:18px;
  border:1px solid var(--muted);
  border-radius:3px;
  font-size:0.5rem;
}

/* PROGRESS BAR */
#progressBar {
  position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:300;
  height:2px; background:var(--border);
}
#progressFill {
  height:100%;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c), var(--c2));
  transition:width 0.4s ease;
}

/* SLIDE LOGO */
.slide-logo {
  position:absolute; top:1.5rem; left:2rem;
  font-family:var(--display); font-size:0.6rem;
  color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:0.15em;
}

/* ===========================
   SLIDE STYLES
   =========================== */

/* SECTION TAG */
.stag {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem;
  color:var(--c); letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;
  margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.stag::before { content:''; width:20px; height:1px; background:var(--c); }

/* HERO — slide 0 */
#s0 {
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 30% 20%, rgba(0,240,255,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 80% 80%, rgba(139,92,246,0.09) 0%, transparent 50%);
}
.hero-title {
  font-family:var(--display);
  font-size:clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  font-weight:900;
  line-height:1.08;
  letter-spacing:-0.03em;
  text-align:center;
  margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}
.hero-title .hl {
  background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--c), var(--c2));
  -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text;
}
.hero-sub { font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--dim); text-align:center; max-width:520px; line-height:1.7; }
.hero-chips { display:flex; gap:0.5rem; justify-content:center; margin-top:2rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.chip {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem;
  padding:0.35rem 0.8rem; border-radius:100px;
  border:1px solid; letter-spacing:0.05em;
}
.chip.fe { color:var(--frontend); border-color:rgba(56,189,248,0.3); background:rgba(56,189,248,0.06); }
.chip.be { color:var(--backend); border-color:rgba(167,139,250,0.3); background:rgba(167,139,250,0.06); }
.chip.do { color:var(--devops); border-color:rgba(251,146,60,0.3); background:rgba(251,146,60,0.06); }
.chip.cy { color:var(--cyber); border-color:rgba(244,114,182,0.3); background:rgba(244,114,182,0.06); }
.chip.ai { color:var(--ai); border-color:rgba(52,211,153,0.3); background:rgba(52,211,153,0.06); }

.hero-stats-row {
  display:flex; gap:1px; margin-top:3rem;
  background:var(--border);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;
}
.hstat { background:var(--surface); padding:1.2rem 2rem; text-align:center; flex:1; }
.hstat .n { font-family:var(--display); font-size:2rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--c); }
.hstat .l { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; color:var(--dim); margin-top:0.25rem; }

/* KIM DASTURCHI — slide 1 */
.two-col { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1.5rem; width:100%; max-width:1100px; }
.myth-r {
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:14px; padding:1.4rem; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.myth-r::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; }
.myth-r.bad::before { background:var(--c6); }
.myth-r.good::before { background:var(--ai); }
.myth-r .mt { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.55rem; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.6rem; }
.myth-r.bad .mt { color:var(--c6); }
.myth-r.good .mt { color:var(--ai); }
.myth-r h3 { font-family:var(--display); font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.5rem; line-height:1.4; }
.myth-r p { font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--dim); line-height:1.6; }

/* SOHALAR — slides 2-6 */
.track-hero {
  width:100%; max-width:1100px;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.6fr; gap:2.5rem;
  align-items:start;
}
.track-left h2 { font-family:var(--display); font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem); font-weight:900; line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:1rem; }
.track-left .tdesc { font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--dim); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:1.2rem; }
.track-salary {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.7rem;
  padding:0.5rem 1rem; border-radius:8px; display:inline-block;
  margin-bottom:1.2rem;
}
.track-tools { display:flex; gap:0.4rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.tool-tag {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.58rem;
  padding:0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius:4px;
  background:var(--surface2); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  color:var(--dim);
}

.track-right {}
.day-example {
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:14px; padding:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.day-example h4 { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; color:var(--dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.15em; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
.task-list { list-style:none; }
.task-list li {
  font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--dim);
  padding:0.4rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:0.6rem;
}
.task-list li:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.task-list li .ti { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; min-width:40px; color:var(--muted); }
.task-list li .tc { flex:1; }
.task-list li .tag { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.52rem; padding:0.1rem 0.4rem; border-radius:3px; }

.code-block {
  background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:10px; padding:1rem 1.2rem;
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.68rem;
  line-height:1.8; overflow:hidden;
}
.code-block .cb-top { display:flex; gap:5px; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
.code-block .cb-top span { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; }
.code-block .cb-top .r { background:#ff5f56; }
.code-block .cb-top .y { background:#ffbd2e; }
.code-block .cb-top .g { background:#27c93f; }
.code-kw { color:#c792ea; }
.code-fn { color:#82aaff; }
.code-str { color:#c3e88d; }
.code-cm { color:#546e7a; }
.code-var { color:#f78c6c; }
.code-num { color:#f78c6c; }

/* PATH SLIDE */
.path-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:1rem; width:100%; max-width:1100px; }
.path-step {
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:14px; padding:1.4rem; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.path-step::after {
  content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px;
}
.path-step .ps-num {
  font-family:var(--display); font-size:4rem; font-weight:900;
  opacity:0.05; position:absolute; top:0; right:0.75rem; line-height:1;
}
.path-step .ps-phase { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.55rem; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:0.4rem; }
.path-step h3 { font-family:var(--display); font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.5rem; }
.path-step .ps-dur { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; padding:0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
.path-step ul { list-style:none; }
.path-step ul li { font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--dim); padding:0.22rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem; }
.path-step ul li:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.path-step ul li::before { content:'▸'; font-size:0.45rem; opacity:0.4; }

/* SOFT SKILLS */
.soft-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1rem; width:100%; max-width:1100px; }
.sc {
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:14px; padding:1.4rem; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.sc::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; }
.sc .si { font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:0.6rem; }
.sc h3 { font-family:var(--display); font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.4rem; }
.sc p { font-size:0.73rem; color:var(--dim); line-height:1.6; }
.sc .ex { margin-top:0.6rem; font-size:0.68rem; font-family:var(--mono); color:var(--muted); padding:0.5rem 0.7rem; background:var(--bg); border-radius:6px; line-height:1.5; }

/* QUIZ */
.quiz-wrap { width:100%; max-width:720px; }
.qcard { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2); border-radius:20px; padding:2.5rem; }
.qprog { display:flex; gap:4px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; }
.qprog .pd { flex:1; height:3px; border-radius:100px; background:var(--border); transition:background 0.3s; }
.qprog .pd.done { background:var(--c); }
.qnum { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:0.4rem; }
.qtext { font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:1.5rem; line-height:1.4; }
.qopts { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.6rem; }
.qopt {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.75rem;
  background:var(--bg); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:10px; padding:0.85rem 1.1rem;
  cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--dim);
}
.qopt:hover { border-color:var(--c); color:var(--text); }
.qopt.sel { border-color:var(--c); background:rgba(0,240,255,0.06); color:var(--text); }
.qoptkey { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.58rem; color:var(--muted); min-width:16px; }
.qnav { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:1.5rem; }
.qbtn {
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.7rem;
  padding:0.6rem 1.3rem; border-radius:8px;
  border:1px solid var(--border2); background:transparent;
  color:var(--dim); cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s;
}
.qbtn:hover { border-color:var(--c); color:var(--c); }
.qbtn.p { background:var(--c); border-color:var(--c); color:var(--bg); }
.qres { display:none; text-align:center; }
.qres .ri { font-size:3.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
.qres .rt { font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:0.5rem; }
.qres .rd { font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--dim); line-height:1.6; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 1.5rem; }
.rtags { display:flex; gap:0.5rem; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.rtag { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; padding:0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius:100px; border:1px solid currentColor; }

/* TAYYOR SLIDE */
.tayyor-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1.5rem; width:100%; max-width:1000px; }
.tg {
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2);
  border-radius:16px; padding:1.8rem;
}
.tg.bad { border-color:rgba(244,63,94,0.25); }
.tg.good { border-color:rgba(74,222,128,0.25); }
.tg-title { font-family:var(--display); font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem; }
.tg.bad .tg-title { color:var(--c6); }
.tg.good .tg-title { color:var(--ai); }
.tgi { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:0.6rem; padding:0.6rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); font-size:0.76rem; color:var(--dim); line-height:1.5; }
.tgi:last-child { border-bottom:none; }

/* MARKET STATS */
.mstats { display:flex; gap:1rem; width:100%; max-width:1100px; margin-top:1.5rem; }
.ms { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2); border-radius:12px; padding:1.2rem 1.5rem; text-align:center; flex:1; }
.ms .mn { font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; }
.ms .ml { font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--dim); margin-top:0.25rem; line-height:1.4; }

/* SALARY BARS */
.sal-bars { width:100%; }
.sal-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:70px 1fr 100px; align-items:center; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; }
.sal-lv { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.6rem; color:var(--dim); text-align:right; }
.bar-t { background:var(--bg); border-radius:100px; height:7px; overflow:hidden; }
.bar-f { height:100%; border-radius:100px; }
.sal-am { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.62rem; color:var(--ai); }

/* ENDING SLIDE */
#s_end { background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(0,240,255,0.1), transparent 60%); }
.end-big { font-family:var(--display); font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem); font-weight:900; text-align:center; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin-bottom:1.5rem; }
.end-sub { font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--dim); text-align:center; max-width:480px; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:2rem; }
.end-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1rem; max-width:700px; }
.eg { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border2); border-radius:12px; padding:1.2rem; text-align:center; }
.eg .en { font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:900; }
.eg .el { font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--dim); margin-top:0.25rem; line-height:1.4; }

/* ANIMATIONS */
@keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
.slide.active > * { animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease forwards; }
.slide.active > *:nth-child(1) { animation-delay:0.05s; opacity:0; }
.slide.active > *:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:0.15s; opacity:0; }
.slide.active > *:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:0.25s; opacity:0; }
.slide.active > *:nth-child(4) { animation-delay:0.35s; opacity:0; }
.slide.active > *:nth-child(5) { animation-delay:0.45s; opacity:0; }

/* Touch areas */
#tapLeft, #tapRight {
  position:fixed; top:0; bottom:0; width:15%; z-index:50;
  cursor:pointer;
}
#tapLeft { left:0; }
#tapRight { right:0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="progressBar"><div id="progressFill"></div></div>

<div id="keyHint">
  <span class="kbd">◀</span>
  <span class="kbd">▶</span>
  KLAVISHLAR / SURING
</div>

<div id="deck">

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 0 — HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="slide active" id="s0">
  <div class="slide-logo">DASTURCHI.UZ — 2025</div>
  <div class="stag">O'zbekiston IT</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">
    Dasturchi bo'lish<br>
    <span class="hl">— Haqiqat qanday?</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Junior darajasiga chiqguncha nima kerak, qaysi yo'lni tanlamoq kerak — hamma savolga aniq, to'g'ridan-to'g'ri javob.</p>
  <div class="hero-chips">
    <span class="chip fe">🎨 Frontend</span>
    <span class="chip be">⚙️ Backend</span>
    <span class="chip do">🚀 DevOps</span>
    <span class="chip cy">🔐 Cybersecurity</span>
    <span class="chip ai">🤖 AI/ML</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats-row">
    <div class="hstat"><div class="n">3×</div><div class="l">IT bozori o'sishi<br>2020–2025</div></div>
    <div class="hstat"><div class="n">$800+</div><div class="l">Junior o'rtacha<br>maosh ($/oy)</div></div>
    <div class="hstat"><div class="n">18 oy</div><div class="l">Junior bo'lish<br>o'rtacha vaqt</div></div>
    <div class="hstat"><div class="n">40K+</div><div class="l">O'zbek IT<br>mutaxassislar</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================
     SLIDE 1 — KIM DASTURCHI
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="slide" id="s1">
  <div class="slide-logo">DASTURCHI.UZ — 2025</div>
  <div class="stag">01 — Haqiqat</div>
  <h2 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Dasturchi haqida miflar vs haqiqat</h2>
  <div class="two-col">
    <div>
      <div class="myth-r bad" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <div class="mt">✗ Mif</div>
        <h3>"Matematik dahosi bo'lmasam bo'lmaydi"</h3>
        <p>Kundalik ish 95% mantiq, muammo yechish va kod yozish. Chuqur matematika faqat AI/Graphics sohasida kerak.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="myth-r bad" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        <div class="mt">✗ Mif</div>
        <h3>"3 oyda junior bo'lsa bo'ladi"</h3>
        <p>Reklama shunday deydi. Haqiqatda ish topishga tayyor Junior — 12–24 oy intensiv o'qish natijasi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="myth-r bad">
